// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
// Source File : texts/Working 	Sheet : Consultant_Frederick 
//
// Script      : Xlstocontactdef.bat 
// Version     : 35 
// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Contact Name : Consultant Frederick 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Name :
"P2089564136" "Consultant Frederick"
// ProfessionString :
"P251825665" "Cultural Direction and Education Center Mentor"
// DescriptionString :
"P2554657939" "Consultant Dalantar Frederick has always been a tinkerer. In his youth, he worked with Neuron at his headquarters in Neutropolis. He was so honored to work with a brilliant visionary that he decided he wanted to use his skills and thrill of device-usage to greater benefit the population of Praetoria. When Emperor Cole offered him his own post at the <color deepskyblue>Cultural Direction and Education Center</color>, he jumped at the opportunity."
// LocationString :
// IDontKnowYouString :
"P711167186" "The visage is not familiar.  Come now, be plain.  Have we met?  Hmmmmm.  Perhaps not.  Well, I can't teach you mid-way through our fine curriculum.  However, if you go speak to <color deepskyblue>Relations Expert Arcola</color>, I'm sure she can enroll you.  Off you go now."
// NoTasksRemainingString :
"P2307416317" "Our time together is at an end, {HeroName}.  If you go see {LastContactName}, you'll find that I have recommended you.  You are a quick learner, not as quick as I am, but not all of us can be called upon by the Emperor of Praetoria can they?"
// PlayerBusyString :
// RelationshipChangeString_ToFriend :
// FailsafeLevelString :
// IntroString :
"P3627098530" "On to Workbenches and Results, {HeroName}.  You'll find it quite fun.  It's an interactive exercise that utilizes our new and innovative Creatavision workbenches!<br><br>Speak to <color DeepSkyBlue>Consultant Dalantar Frederick</color> in the Lab and he'll get you started."
// IntroAcceptString :
// IntroSendoffString :
"P3668955459" "Your next exercise will be <color GreenYellow>Workbenches & Results: Materials + Inspiration = A New You</color> mentored by:"
// IntroduceOneContact :
"P1340667023" "I'm quite sure that your experience with me has been most insightful.  Well of course it has been.  Emperor Cole doesn't choose just anyone to teach on his behalf, now does he?"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - FirstVisitString 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Page LicRequiresCheck Text :
// Answer Text :
// Page TokenCheck Text :
// Answer Text :
// Page MissionAccept Text :
"P2464014859" "I am Dalantar Frederick.  I am a designer of the highest order, called upon by the Emperor himself for my excellence and knowledge of the Invention system.  This is a dual-purpose exercise program in both Workbenches and Results.  You are very lucky to be learning what I have to teach."
// Answer Text :

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - HelloString 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Page MissionAccept Text :
"P2440418248" "Why, helloooo, {HeroName}.  What kinds of inventive mischief should we find ourselves in today?"
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 


