// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
// Source File : texts/Working 	Sheet : Consultant_Highland 
//
// Script      : Xlstocontactdef.bat 
// Version     : 35 
// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Contact Name : Consultant Highland 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Name :
"P362080328" "Consultant Highland"
// ProfessionString :
// DescriptionString :
"P2715793631" "Ever since Amaia Highland experienced the life-changing mentorship of the <color deepskyblue>Cultural Direction and Education Center</color>, she went through rigorous training, and became one!  She has dedicated her life to serving the Center in any way she can.  She is now a Consultant and loves Recipe instruction so much that she re-wrote the textbook!"
// LocationString :
// IDontKnowYouString :
"P2017507339" "Have we met before, Citizen?  I don't think we have because I never forget a face.<br><br>So here is my conundrum: I don't recognize you.  Since I don't recognize you, you must not be on my program list.  And THAT would be a shame!  <br><br>Why don't you go speak to <color deepskyblue>Relations Expert Verna Arcola</color> and she can get you all settled in!"
// NoTasksRemainingString :
"P238639694" "Well, stick a fork in our time together because this exercise is done.  Hee hee!  Another cooking reference!  I do crack myself up!  Wait!  I crack myself up, like an egg!  I'm on a roll!  Roll!  Anyway, you should go see {LastContactName} now so that he can teach you something new!"
// PlayerBusyString :
"P1650644247" "You know, {HeroName}, if you juggle too many eggs, you're going to drop a few.  Maybe you need to organize your kitchen a little before you talk to me."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToFriend :
// FailsafeLevelString :
// IntroString :
"P3430997456" "It is time to move on to your next exercise in Recipes.  It is quite simply the  backbone of the Invention system.  Without Salvage and Recipes there would be no Invention system!  <br><br><color DeepSkyBlue>Consultant Amaia Highland</color> is a lovely woman who will teach you more about the types of Recipes that you can find (or purchase), what types of rarity there are, and what is required to use them.<br><br>Off you go now.  Consultant Highland upstairs on the second floor."
// IntroAcceptString :
// IntroSendoffString :
"P903931137" "Your next exercise will be <color GreenYellow>Recipes: Using Recipes That Make Cole Proud</color> mentored by:"
// IntroduceOneContact :
"P1263325183" "Our time has been most pleasant.  Now is time to move on to your next enriching exercise."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - FirstVisitString 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Page LicRequiresCheck Text :
// Answer Text :
// Page TokenCheck Text :
// Answer Text :
// Page MissionAccept Text :
"P2775760797" "What's cooking, {HeroName}?  Ha!  Do you get it?  That's a little Recipe humor for you. Wait, where was I?<br><br>Oh!  Right.  Consultant Rupert speaks highly of you.  I suppose whatever little task you completed for him was a success because he's been singing your praises to me."
// Answer Text :

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - HelloString 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Page MissionAccept Text :
"P2954927727" "Hello, {HeroName}!  It's a great day to fire up some new recipes!"
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 


