// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
// Source File : texts/Working 	Sheet : Consultant_Ross 
//
// Script      : Xlstocontactdef.bat 
// Version     : 35 
// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Contact Name : Consultant Ross 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Name :
"P3776418441" "Consultant Ross"
// ProfessionString :
// DescriptionString :
"P3421653959" "Consultant Grant Ross has always been fascinated with technology and constantly searches for new ways to make Praetoria even more perfect than it already is. He toils for hours on end in the Creatavision Lab to do just that: create a vision. He believes that through Invented Enhancements Cole-style, all Praetorians can be more than they are right now."
// LocationString :
// IDontKnowYouString :
"P708842650" "I am afraid that your face is not familiar, Citizen.  Have you not been officially introduced to the Cultural Direction and Education Center?  Oh well that must change!  Do see <color deepskyblue>Relations Expert Verna Arcola</color> and she will tell you where to start."
// NoTasksRemainingString :
"P2148802061" "You have done very well, {HeroName}.  Unfortunately, our time of learning together has come to an end.  However, if you speak to {LastContactName}, you can continue your education with her."
// PlayerBusyString :
"P162623008" "{HeroName}, if I were you I would take a long and soulful look at my life's order and perhaps make a few adjustments then come back later and see me."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToFriend :
// FailsafeLevelString :
// IntroString :
"P605305756" "Invention Enhancements are a wonder because they do not expire.  You will learn the basics of this concept such as how to create them and what types of rules apply.<br><br><color DeepSkyBlue>Consultant Grant Ross</color> is located in the Lab and would be very happy to teach you more."
// IntroAcceptString :
// IntroSendoffString :
"P2790258827" "Your next exercise will be <color GreenYellow>Invention Enhancements: Inventing a New Mindset</color> mentored by:"
// IntroduceOneContact :
"P3786360480" "You did a fine job, {HeroName}.  I'm very proud of your intellect and ingenuity.  I'm very gratified to have mentored you."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - FirstVisitString 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Page LicRequiresCheck Text :
// Answer Text :
// Page TokenCheck Text :
// Answer Text :
// Page MissionAccept Text :
"P1304096035" "An inspiring day to you, {HeroName}.  I see you on my list here so let me introduce myself.  I am Grant Ross and I will be instructing you on the wonderful world of Invention Enhancements."
// Answer Text :

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - HelloString 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Page MissionAccept Text :
"P2202598173" "Today is another opportunity to make ourselves as perfect as Praetoria.  Don't you agree, {HeroName}?"
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 


