// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
// Source File : texts/Working 	Sheet : Consultant_Rupert 
//
// Script      : Xlstocontactdef.bat 
// Version     : 35 
// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Contact Name : Consultant Rupert 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Name :
"P3753276380" "Consultant Rupert"
// ProfessionString :
// DescriptionString :
"P4131247105" "Consultant Phinneas Rupert is both an educator and a stalwart champion of the recycling cause.  His vast knowledge of Salvage and its uses are highly sought out all over Praetoria, both as an educator and as an activist.  Phinneas is a relative newcomer to the CDEC family, but his quirky personality and fervent loyalty to Emperor Cole has made him a most welcome and valued employee as well as an ideal mentor for the citizens of Praetoria."
// LocationString :
// IDontKnowYouString :
"P2204982160" "You have such an appealing 'I want to grow!' aura about you.  Unfortunately, I have not yet seen a prepared Program list with your name on it.  <br><br>That is a problem.  Oh, how about this: go speak to <color deepskyblue>Miss Verna Arcola</color> and she will enroll you right away.  You do not want to miss this program!  It would be a shame to start halfway through."
// PlayerBusyString :
"P1982871289" "I'm really busy here, {HeroName}.  And so are you, apparently.  You should get your affairs in order before darkening my doorstep, as it were."
// NoTasksRemainingString :
"P705213418" "Well, that is all I have to teach you for now, {HeroName}.  Has it not been an exceptionally exciting and notably knowledgeable time we have had together?  Of course it has. Now, you should move on to {LastContactName}.  You are definitely expected."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToFriend :
// FailsafeLevelString :
// IntroString :
"P3952001182" "Salvage is a crucial component in the Invention system.  As you move on to your next enriching experience, you will learn more about Salvage: how to get it, where to sell it, and what it does.<br><br><color DeepSkyBlue>Consultant Rupert</color> will be more than happy to give you his knowledge on the subject.  He is located in the Resource Center on the first floor."
// IntroAcceptString :
// IntroSendoffString :
"P924584138" "Your next exercise will be <color GreenYellow>Salvage: Recycling for Cole's Grandeur</color> mentored by:"
// IntroduceOneContact :
"P3012060625" "Salvage is just one small way that we can use the materials available to us in a way that truly illustrates our compassion for our environment and our great loyalty and gratitude for Emperor Cole and all he has done for us!  You did a fine job, {HeroName}!  I'm very honored to send you on to your next program!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - FirstVisitString 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Page LicRequiresCheck Text :
// Answer Text :
// Page TokenCheck Text :
// Answer Text :
// Page MissionAccept Text :
"P1216884321" "Do you realize how incredibly lucky you are to have a moment with me, {HeroName}?  Ever since we implemented the Inventions Program I have been inundated by Praetorians wishing to learn more about Salvage."
// Answer Text :

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - HelloString 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Page MissionAccept Text :
"P50310699" "Greetings, {HeroName}."
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 


