// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
// Source File : texts/Working 	Sheet : RE_Arcola 
//
// Script      : Xlstocontactdef.bat 
// Version     : 35 
// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Contact Name : Relations Expert Verna Arcola 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Name :
"P525604802" "Relations Expert Verna Arcola"
// ProfessionString :
"P2352363643" "Cultural Direction and Education Center Relations Expert"
// DescriptionString :
"P546429463" "Relations Expert Verna Arcola has been a figurehead at the Cultural Direction and Education Center for many years.  She was hand-picked by Emperor Cole for her energy, loyalty, and dedication.  Verna has proven herself an effective administrator and popular public figurehead."
// LocationString :
// IDontKnowYouString :
"P4152728364" "My most sincere apologies, {HeroName}, but the many programs and activities we're running here at the <color deepskyblue>Cultural Direction and Education Center</color> have completely overwhelmed me and I have not yet had the pleasure of an introduction.<br><br>Perhaps you could arrange one with {LastContactName} so that I may properly attend to you via an appointment?  I would be remiss in my duties if I were not able to give you the proper attention you deserve!"
// NoTasksRemainingString :
"P890036934" "I've given you all the information you need about the Invention system.  If you need to brush up on the information, go back to your learning materials from your enrichment exercises."
// PlayerBusyString :
"P48712696" "Oh dear.  This is a place of learning and personal growth, {HeroName}.  However can you absorb all that we wish to teach if your mind is not focused?  It simply cannot be done!  Now then, go and clear your mind of all other matters and come back here when you are done.  Don't worry, we will be waiting."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToFriend :
"P572991084" "This is so exciting!  So let's get you started right this minute!  No time to waste when we have an opportunity to learn!<br><br>The console here is at your disposal so that you may come back any time you wish and read over our program."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToConfidant :
"P352113253" "Let's get you started right this minute!  No time to waste when we have an opportunity to learn!<br><br>The console here is at your disposal so that you may come back any time you wish and read over our program."
// FailsafeLevelString :
// IntroString :
"P1888573829" "You should go speak to Relations Expert <color DeepSkyBlue>Verna Arcola</color> about the new Invention Program.<br><br>She is located in the front lobby of the Cultural Direction and Education Center."
// IntroAcceptString :
"P2571289134" "You're going to find this new program such a wonderful and enriching experience, {HeroName}!"
// IntroSendoffString :
"P1751365580" "Verna Arcola will be quite pleased to help you learn more about the new Invention Program at the Cultural Direction and Education Center, {HeroName}."
// IntroduceOneContact :
"P4136083244" "Well here we go!  It is time for your very first growth exercise: <color GreenYellow>Salvage: Recycling for Cole's Grandeur</color>!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - FirstVisitString 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Page LicRequiresCheck Text :
// Answer Text :
// Page TokenCheck Text :
// Answer Text :
// Page MissionAccept Text :
"P852730686" "{HeroName}, welcome to the <color deepskyblue>Cultural Direction and Education Center</color>.  Can I just say how pleased we are to have you here?  My name is Verna Arcola and I am the center's Relations Expert. <br><br>We have just implemented a brand new curriculum here called the <color greenyellow>Inventions Program for Enlightened Citizens Advocating Cole</color>!  Doesn't that sound wonderful?  I came up with that catchy acronym myself!<br><br><font color=deepskyblue>This is the Invention Tutorial.  It should take you approximately 10 minutes to complete.  Click on 'Ask about available missions' to start the tutorial.</font>"
// Answer Text :

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - HelloString 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Page MissionAccept Text :
"P2592016366" "Greetings, {HeroName}.  It is so good to see you!"
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

